Chapter: BoundedParamNinth

 The ninth parameter arrives on the stack on arm64 and riscv, past the eight
 argument registers, and on x86-64 past the six. feed threads 300 into
 pick9's ninth parameter, bounded 0..255, and the entry guard traps.

Section: Definitions

  pick9 : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer between 0 and 255 -> Integer
  pick9 (a) (b) (c) (d) (e) (f) (g) (h) (n) = n + 1

  feed : Integer -> Integer
  feed (x) = pick9 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 (__narrow x)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
   print-line-uni (integer-to-text (feed 300))
  end
